# Feature module

- Business logic lives under `apps/web/features/<name>/`, not in `app/` pages
- **Public API:** `features/<name>/index.ts` — export only what other layers need
- Folders: `components/`, `actions/`, `hooks/`, `validations/`, `types/`, optional `stores/`, `utils/`
- Never import from other `features/*` (cross-feature)
- kebab-case files; PascalCase components
- Detail: [docs/04-feature-module.md](../docs/04-feature-module.md)
